WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 2.2 · Theory of Change
Defining the problem

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Define the problem and its causes before you choose your solution.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Separate symptoms from causes.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Ask why until you reach causes you can influence.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Mark what you do not know as hypotheses.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Weavers earn little and irregularly: middlemen take most of the price, yarn bought alone costs more, power-loom copies undercut them.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write the problem, its scope, causes and evidence.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
